# Skills Are Editable

The `.cursor/skills/` directory contains Cursor skills for this project. Skills **may be modified** when the user explicitly requests an update or when a fix needs to be codified into the skill.

- Use skills when prompted (e.g. "Analyze my database", "Project storage growth").
- Edit skills when the user asks, or when domain logic (e.g. hash key patterns, warehouse defaults) needs to be captured for future runs.
- Document changes in the SKILL.md so future agents pick up the updated guidance.
